      obo:IAO_0000112 "the median sulcus of your tongue"@en , "all geopolitical boundaries"@en , "all lines of latitude and longitude"@en , "the line separating the outer surface of the mucosa of the lower lip from the outer surface of the skin of the chin."@en , "The Equator"@en ;
